OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells initially this evening with
OL,7,Fskies turning cloudier from the west
OL,8,Fwith drizzly interludes returning
OL,9,Facross the hills. A band of heavier
OL,10,Frain arriving from the west towards
OL,11,Fdawn. Breezy, and strong winds for
OL,12,Fexposed areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA wet and windy start as
OL,15,Fheavy rain clears eastwards. Despite
OL,16,Fthe sunny spells, the afternoon will
OL,17,Ffeel cooler than on Monday with a
OL,18,Ffresh, blustery breeze following the
OL,19,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
