OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FOn
OL,6,FWednesday, bright spells but
OL,7,Fincreasingly strong winds with coastal
OL,8,Fgales. Winds easing through Thursday,
OL,9,Fbut a band of heavy rain passes. A
OL,10,Fsunnier, more settled Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
